        <content>
          <p style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">Calculate the ideal resonance, including Cp.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="171" width="90" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Ct</e>
          <e type="operand">C</e>
          <e type="operand">Cp</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="180" width="252" height="43" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">f.0</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operand">π</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">L</e>
          <e type="operand">Ct</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">sqrt</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">5.9562</e>
          <e type="operand">10</e>
          <e type="operand">9</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">Hz</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="234" width="774" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" width="774" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">Find the inductive and capacitive reactance at 5.8 GHz.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="252" width="191" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">X.L</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operand">π</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">F</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">L</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">61.9522</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">Ω</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="270" width="216" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">X.C</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="operator" args="1">-</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operand">π</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">F</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">Ct</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">65.3345</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">Ω</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="1">-</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="324" width="774" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" width="774" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">Estimate the loaded Q with Rp = 500 Ω.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="342" width="175" height="46" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Q</e>
          <e type="operand">Rp</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operand">π</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">f.0</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">L</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">7.8591</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="387" width="788" height="83" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="775" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>
            <span style="font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;">What changes when you include component losses and internal parasitic?</span>
            <span />
            <br />
            <br />
            <span style="font-style: italic;">Including component losses reduces the peak impedance and loaded quality factor below the ideal value of 7.86. Internal parasitics, such as the inductor’s winding capacitance and the capacitor’s series inductance, modify their impedances and can shift the resonant frequency away from the calculated 5.956 GHz.</span>
          </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
  </regions>
